@startuml deployment
title FHIR Studio Platform Deployment Footprint & Architecture

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45

cloud "Client Layer" as Clients {
  actor "Developer / Clinician\n(Browser)" as DevUser
  [SMART on FHIR App\n(Custom / Sample)] as SmartApp
  [Remote CDS Service\n(Hooks Endpoint)] as CdsService
}

node "FHIR Studio UI" as UiTier {
  [Angular SPA\n(Bootstrap & ECharts)] as UI
}

node "FHIR Studio Server (Express / Node.js ESM)" as ServerTier {
  [BFF Auth & Sessions\n(HttpOnly Cookies)] as BffAuth
  [SMART on FHIR v2 IdP\n(OAuth2 / OIDC / PKCE / JWKS)] as SmartIdp
  [FHIR Gateway & Proxy\n(Scope & Partition Enforcement)] as FhirGateway
  [CDS Hooks 2.0 Engine\n(Service Dispatch & Testing)] as CdsEngine
  [Bulk Export Engine\n(Async $export / NDJSON)] as BulkExport
  [Subscription Hub\n(WebSocket & Webhooks)] as SubHub
  [Sandbox & App Manager\n(Personas, Scenarios, IAM)] as CoreServices
}

node "Identity & SSO" as SsoTier {
  [Authentik SSO Server\n(OIDC Provider)] as AuthentikServer
  [Authentik Worker] as AuthentikWorker
  database "Redis" as AuthentikRedis
}

node "FHIR Storage Layer" as FhirTier {
  [HAPI FHIR R4 JPA\n(Partitioned)] as HapiR4
  [HAPI FHIR R4B JPA\n(Partitioned)] as HapiR4B
  [HAPI FHIR R5 JPA\n(Partitioned)] as HapiR5
}

database "PostgreSQL 18" as DatabaseTier {
  database "FHIR Studio DB\n(Prisma Schema)" as AppDb
  database "Authentik DB" as AuthentikDb
  database "HAPI R4 DB" as HapiR4Db
  database "HAPI R4B DB" as HapiR4BDb
  database "HAPI R5 DB" as HapiR5Db
}

DevUser --> UI : HTTPS (Port 4200)
UI --> ServerTier : REST API / WebSocket (Port 3000)\n(Session Cookie)
DevUser ..> AuthentikServer : OIDC Authorize (BFF flow)
BffAuth --> AuthentikServer : Token Exchange / Discovery (Port 9000)

SmartApp --> SmartIdp : SMART v2 Authorize / Token\n(OAuth2, PKCE S256, JWKS)
SmartApp --> FhirGateway : FHIR REST API (Bearer Token)\n/api/sandboxes/:id/fhir/:ver
FhirGateway --> HapiR4 : Reverse Proxy + Tenant Header\n(Port 8083)
FhirGateway --> HapiR4B : Reverse Proxy + Tenant Header\n(Port 8084)
FhirGateway --> HapiR5 : Reverse Proxy + Tenant Header\n(Port 8085)

CdsEngine --> CdsService : HTTP POST (Hook Context)
SubHub --> SmartApp : WebSocket / Webhook Notifications

ServerTier --> AppDb : Prisma ORM (Port 5433)
AuthentikServer --> AuthentikDb : Relational Store
AuthentikServer --> AuthentikRedis : Session / Tasks Cache
AuthentikWorker --> AuthentikRedis : Claim Tasks
HapiR4 --> HapiR4Db : JPA Resource Storage
HapiR4B --> HapiR4BDb : JPA Resource Storage
HapiR5 --> HapiR5Db : JPA Resource Storage

note right of FhirGateway
  FHIR Gateway dynamically injects
  HAPI multi-tenant partition IDs,
  enforces SMART v2 fine-grained scopes,
  and rewrites resource URLs.
end note

note bottom of SmartIdp
  SMART on FHIR v2 IdP supports:
  - Dynamic Client Registration (RFC 7591)
  - Confidential & Public Clients (PKCE S256)
  - Asymmetric Private Key JWT (RFC 7523)
  - Granular Scopes & Custom Context Params
end note

@enduml
